{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/40820-demon-font","id":40820,"title":"Demon Font","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-01T16:59:34-08:00","id":40820,"title":"Demon Font","content":"Would like to know if anyone knows the name of font used in the intro fiction (I assume this is the official font for the setting)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T18:52:05-08:00","id":40881,"title":"","content":"Demon uses alot of fonts, here is a bit of a rundown. (For my own reference as well later).<br /> <br /> Enemy Action, top heading is in <b>Microscan-A</b><br /> The rest of Enemy Action is in <b>OCRAStd</b><br /> <br /> Three Days is entirely in <b>Fudge</b>.<br /> <br /> General Heading through out the book is in <b>Crack-Babies-SC700</b><br /> <br /> Main body text is in <b>GoudyOldStyleT-***</b>. (Where *** is regular, italic or bold as used.).<br /> <br /> Sidebar headings are in <b>Conspiracy</b>.<br /> The chapter name in the header text is in <b>Conspiracy</b> also, and page numbers are <b>Conspiracy-Bold</b>.<br /> Sidebar text is in <b>FuturaT-Book</b>. (Interesting that the body text is Serif, but the sidebar are are sanserif)<br /> <b>FuturaT-Book </b>is also used inside tables with table heading is <b>FuturaT-Bol</b><b>d</b>.<br /> <br /> <br /> Interesting the index, single letters headings a different font again: <b>Fandango</b>.<br /> <b>Fandango </b>is also used for the SAS sytle scene focus legend (Eg: MENTAL \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 PHYSICAL \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 SOCIAL \u2022\u2022)<br /> <br /> <b>VintageTypewriter-Corona</b> is uses in some of the character quotes, in Appendix 1 (Seattle)<br /> <br /> <b>AmericanTypewriter-Medium </b>is uses on the story on page 356 of the formatted pdf.<br /> <br /> These are just the main ones.<br /> there are quiet a few other fonts used, but I can't find where.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1699,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1699-oxinabox","user":"oxinabox","date":". 01-01-2014, 09:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1699-oxinabox","name":"oxinabox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T21:23:26-07:00","id":244502,"title":"","content":"Old thread, but what about the font for the header, or the chapter titles?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":"